    {
      "name": "reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2w4d2RGcEdSemRFZEc5aE4wSXlMV05sUTJneVlXYxAB",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "3 месяца назад",
      "rating": 5,
      "text": {
        "text": "During my vacation, when you least expect any problems, a wire from my braces turned a carefree holiday into days of pain and discomfort. On the recommendation of my younger sister Dragana, whose orthodontic treatment was completed by Prof. Dr. Snežana Matijević and Prof. Dr. Jasminka Anđelić with outstanding results, I reached out to them for help.\n\nFrom the moment I walked into the clinic, I felt I was in the right place. They saw me immediately, without any waiting, and within just a few minutes resolved the problem that had been causing me severe pain and bleeding. Their knowledge, expertise, confidence, built on decades of experience, and exceptional professionalism are matched only by the kindness, warmth, and genuine care they show every patient.\n\nIt is often said that true professionals reveal themselves when they are needed most. Prof. Dr. Snežana Matijević and Prof. Dr. Jasminka Anđelić proved exactly that through their prompt response, dedication, and willingness to help without hesitation. I believe that every great profession is founded on a love for one’s work, but above all, on compassion for the person who places their trust in your hands. It is this rare combination of outstanding expertise and genuine humanity that truly sets them apart.\n\nMy heartfelt thanks to Prof. Dr. Snežana Matijević and Prof. Dr. Jasminka Anđelić for their swift help, compassion, and exceptional care. Dentalux has my warmest recommendation to anyone seeking excellence, professionalism, and a truly caring approach. I wish you continued success and many more happy, smiling patients",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
      "originalText": {
