    {
      "name": "reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2t0cFQwTm1URzA1YjBjeWEyOHdaMlIxY0hGM1ZtYxAB",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "3 месяца назад",
      "rating": 5,
      "text": {
        "text": "Jako sam zadovoljan sa rezultatima koje smo postigli nošenjem fiksne proteze za samo godinu dana smo riješili problem za koji su mnogi ortodonti rekli da se mora radit operacija,imao sam otvoren zagrižaj i usku vilicu ,zahvaljujući njima sada je sve oky.\nPreporučio bih svako me ovakve eksperte u svome poslu ..veliko vam hvala\n\nI am very satisfied with the results we achieved by wearing fixed prostheses, in just one year we solved the problem that many orthodontists said required surgery, I had an open bite and a narrow jaw, thanks to them everything is ok now.\nI would recommend such experts to everyone in their work...thank you very much",
        "languageCode": "hr"
      },
      "originalText": {
        "text": "Jako sam zadovoljan sa rezultatima koje smo postigli nošenjem fiksne proteze za samo godinu dana smo riješili problem za koji su mnogi ortodonti rekli da se mora radit operacija,imao sam otvoren zagrižaj i usku vilicu ,zahvaljujući njima sada je sve oky.\nPreporučio bih svako me ovakve eksperte u svome poslu ..veliko vam hvala\n\nI am very satisfied with the results we achieved by wearing fixed prostheses, in just one year we solved the problem that many orthodontists said required surgery, I had an open bite and a narrow jaw, thanks to them everything is ok now.\nI would recommend such experts to everyone in their work...thank you very much",
        "languageCode": "hr"
      },
